{"version":1,"key":"card:464","content":{"id":464,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"57f7eb17-4ffe-4e0b-b213-0d6ae3b8433c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要指定超类，可在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"class"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中的类名后加上超类名，并将其用圆括号括起"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"6d72fc36-803e-4ed3-ae58-280bf14108ae","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"983f62fb-36bd-475a-9a1f-26bafbb96c00","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Filter:\n    def init(self):\n      self.blocked = []\n    def filter(self, sequence):\n      return [x for x in sequence if x not in self.blocked]\n\n\nclass SPAMFilter(Filter): # SPAMFilter是Filter的子类\n    def init(self): # 重写超类Filter的方法init\n      self.blocked = ['SPAM']","collabId":"cd1ccbbd-9a45-4526-ba99-b8de53f22999","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"501ef170-72c5-4824-9f10-c1d00e55b95b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要确定一个类是否是另一个类的子类，可使用内置方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"issubclass"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"45f23c95-a1e8-415a-b5de-0b4e2bf8f773","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"92963566-9926-41c6-95de-3be788a856b8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> issubclass(SPAMFilter, Filter)\nTrue\n>>> issubclass(Filter, SPAMFilter)\nFalse","collabId":"634fe142-ab2c-4e53-bffd-ba5629627357","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5ec5ecc-a455-4bed-ae2d-3a7f963ce4ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你有一个类，并想知道它的基类，可访问其特殊属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__bases__"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"c3cb2467-0a36-4f22-ad16-cbabd2e46df3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b7d0b76b-5c7f-43c6-900d-dfd2423c55cc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> SPAMFilter.__bases__\n(<class __main__.Filter at 0x171e40>,)\n>>> Filter.__bases__\n(<class 'object'>,)","collabId":"a3082a7a-9231-4fe7-9f21-d5de0436702e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23f0cd08-e26a-46ec-8917-426eebb327e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要确定对象是否是特定类的实例，可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"isinstance"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"f82c08ef-5979-4f11-aa55-8df7e242352a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d7487d34-3e5b-4add-a8d2-980a5b6f1719","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> s = SPAMFilter()\n>>> isinstance(s, SPAMFilter)\nTrue\n>>> isinstance(s, Filter)\nTrue\n>>> isinstance(s, str)\nFalse","collabId":"55ee73da-1ace-45e4-bb35-77fd4ed8f007","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"01b5f896-f2e5-402d-b027-ecd4d0f5a929","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ab0beaa-5e7e-4ce8-a002-b6082c4346e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"isinstance"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通常不是良好的做法，依赖多态在任何情况下都是更好的选择。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ede9e2cd-e177-404f-9209-bc980ac74d4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你要获悉对象属于哪个类，可使用属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"__class__"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"1b946aa9-fe2d-4b0b-a133-09e92b29cefb","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"02db2aa1-738a-4e27-8cf1-f37ece4dbabb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> s.__class__\n<class __main__.SPAMFilter at 0x1707c0>","collabId":"69a5a3d8-7e9f-4b6e-958c-f314cdc0f738","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"6e81caae-a7a5-4b0f-b738-d5b98101ff97","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"481fb3f9-0204-48dd-90d2-75e260ae2690","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type(s)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来获悉其所属的类。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66b5b1d4-ce62-4baf-8321-41b21a70eb38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"继承多个类"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"55fa6065-e7cd-4c3e-9bbd-82521a2afe5a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3372cf48-2e96-411f-be3b-c65b856365f1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Calculator:\n    def calculate(self, expression):\n      self.value = eval(expression)\n\n\nclass Talker:\n    def talk(self):\n      print('Hi, my value is', self.value)\n\n\nclass TalkingCalculator(Calculator, Talker):\n    pass","collabId":"e10658dd-cb78-4908-9734-97a1be33a172","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"40accbf0-0efd-4e10-8f20-d6512b40c732","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除非万不得已，否则应避免使用多重继承，因为在有些情况下，它可能带来意外的“并发症”。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"599d6423-afff-484f-b845-2baf3bf83631","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b61dceba-e22c-4dca-b6a1-d8e91f58bf2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用多重继承时，有一点务必注意：如果多个超类以不同的方式实现了同一个方法（即有多个同名方法），必须在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"class"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中小心排列这些超类，因为位于"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"771166dc-4706-49fb-bee6-3f165f844b85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前面的类的方法将覆盖位于后面的类的方法"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]}],"tags":["Python/类"],"createTime":1719226234025,"updateTime":1767362191164,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767362191164}}